&lt;div&gt;Experience in tech due diligence or post-merger transformation projects.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prior technical background as an engineer or developer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
